  "body": "looking at the [spec](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interactive-elements.html#dom-dialog-show) for `<dialog>`, `Set this's previously focused element to the focused element` doesn't account the case where the current focused element is in a different same-origin frame. We should be able to allow moving focus to that. \r\n\r\nApologies since I added this line. I am not sure the correct wording to fix it.   ",
